From 20bc4d8a29552f695efcfae8f4f459954dbc2855 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anne van Kesteren <annevk@annevk.nl>
Date: Fri, 20 Jun 2025 07:55:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Rename domWindow() to window()
 https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=294750

Reviewed by Tyler Wilcock.

Addresses an existing FIXME and makes the name consistent with
protectedWindow().

Except for ScriptCachedFrameData.cpp where it created a conflict, local
variables have been renamed as well.

Canonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/296441@main
